  eventId: Opening
  title: "R\u1EDCI B\u1EBEN"
  briefingText: "B\u1EBEN GIAO NH\u1EACN ZORP\n\nTh\xF9ng b\xE1nh \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    ch\u1EA5t l\xEAn t\xE0u. Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi r\u1EDDi b\u1EBFn, nh\xE2n vi\xEAn
    b\u1EBFn y\xEAu c\u1EA7u thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng x\xE1c nh\u1EADn ni\xEAm
    phong th\xF9ng h\xE0ng.\n\nM\u1EE4C TI\xCAU H\xD4M NAY: r\u1EDDi b\u1EBFn an
    to\xE0n.\nL\u01AFU \xDD: d\xE2y bu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1 3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    thay v\u1ED9i \u1EDF b\u1EBFn."
  statusText: "T\xC0U: \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh.\nB\xC1NH: {CARGO}.\n\nDEX: \"C\xF3
    g\xEC \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n v\u1EDBi d\xE2y bu\u1ED9c. T\xF4i c\u1EA3m
    th\u1EA5y n\xF3.\"\nBOB: \"T\xF4i s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng l\xE0m b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9
    g\xEC!\"\nMIRA: \"T\xF4i s\u1EBD l\xE0m \u0111\xFAng theo ch\u1EC9 d\u1EABn.\"\nCHEN:
    \"C\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0m sau \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\xF4ng?\""
